  "Settings sections": "設定區段",
  "Share of this process that the .NET heap holds; thumbnails and folder size walks live here. The runtime grows it on demand and gives it back after a collection.": "此處理程序中由 .NET 堆積持有的比例；縮圖與資料夾大小計算都在此。執行階段會視需要擴充，並在回收後歸還。",
  "Shortcut": "捷徑",
  "Show a checkbox before every name, the way Explorer does. Checked entries can be copied, cut or deleted together.": "在每個名稱前顯示核取方塊，就像檔案總管。已勾選的項目可以一起複製、剪下或刪除。",
  "Show all (admin)…": "顯示全部 (管理員)…",
  "Show details panel": "顯示詳細資料面板",
  "Show file tray": "顯示檔案托盤",
  "Show in Explorer": "在檔案總管中顯示",
  "Show metadata records whose content is already gone": "顯示內容已不存在的中繼資料記錄",
  "Showing the first 256 KB.": "僅顯示前 256 KB。",
  "Shown": "顯示",
  "Shown in every folder; changing them changes all folders at once.": "在所有資料夾中顯示；變更會一次套用到所有資料夾。",
  "Shows the pictures, videos and documents the shell can preview as grid tiles below the list. The tiles follow the grid size, and the panel only appears in list mode.": "在清單下方以格狀磚顯示殼層可預覽的圖片、影片與文件。磚會跟隨格狀大小，且面板只在清單模式出現。",
  "Size": "大小",
  "Split view": "分割檢視",
  "Status": "狀態",
  "Stop opening yafm:// links": "停止開啟 yafm:// 連結",
  "Stop scanning this folder": "停止掃描此資料夾",
  "Stored in the folder's parent {index}, so it stays with the files.": "儲存在資料夾上層的 {index}，因此會跟著檔案一起移動。",
  "Suggested apps": "建議的應用程式",
  "Symbolic link": "符號連結",
  "System": "系統",
  "System default": "系統預設",
  "Tags": "標籤",
  "Target": "目標",
  "The administrator view is already loaded": "已載入管理員檢視",
  "The default view, list icon size and grid size are only defaults: a folder can still remember its own from the title bar.": "預設檢視、清單圖示大小與格狀大小只是預設值：資料夾仍可從標題列記住自己的設定。",
  "The files could not be transferred.": "無法傳輸檔案。",
  "The height of a grid tile; the icon inside follows it.": "格狀磚的高度；其中的圖示會跟隨調整。",
  "The icon in the list rows.": "清單列中的圖示。",
  "The language the interface uses. English is the default; the system option follows the operating system.": "介面使用的語言。預設為英文；系統選項會跟隨作業系統。",
  "The mode every folder starts with. A folder can still remember its own list or grid mode from the title bar.": "每個資料夾一開始使用的模式。資料夾仍可從標題列記住自己的清單或格狀模式。",
  "The recycle bin is empty.": "資源回收筒是空的。",
  "The runtime, loaded libraries and the Rust helper share this part. Rust runs inside the process, so it has no separate figure.": "執行階段、已載入的程式庫與 Rust 輔助程式共用這部分。Rust 在程式程序內執行，因此沒有獨立數字。",
