  "Restored {done} of {total} items.": "已還原 {total} 個項目中的 {done} 個。",
  "Deleted {done} of 1 item.": "已刪除 1 個項目中的 {done} 個。",
  "Deleted {done} of {total} items.": "已刪除 {total} 個項目中的 {done} 個。",
  "Used in 1 folder. Renaming or removing it updates that folder's index.": "用於 1 個資料夾。重新命名或移除會更新該資料夾的索引。",
  "Used in {count} folders. Renaming or removing it updates those folders' indexes.": "用於 {count} 個資料夾。重新命名或移除會更新這些資料夾的索引。",
  "Add preset": "新增預設集",
  "Preset name": "預設集名稱",
  "Remove preset": "移除預設集",
  "Save the current colours as a preset": "將目前的顏色儲存為預設集",
  "Application": "應用程式",
  "The build, its yafm:// links, and what reopens at launch.": "版本、yafm:// 連結，以及啟動時要重新開啟的內容。",
  "Colors": "色彩",
  "The accent and highlight colours the whole window uses.": "整個視窗使用的強調色與醒目提示色。",
  "Every tag the catalogue has seen, ready to rename or remove.": "目錄中出現過的每個標籤，可重新命名或移除。",
  "Files view": "檔案檢視",
  "Files view (global)": "檔案檢視 (全域)",
  "The defaults every folder starts with; a folder can still override them.": "每個資料夾的預設值；資料夾仍可覆寫。",
  "Shortcuts": "快速鍵",
  "The keys this window listens for. Click a combination to record a new one.": "此視窗監聽的按鍵。按一下組合鍵即可錄製新的組合。",
  "Memory": "記憶體",
  "What the process holds and how to give it back.": "處理程序佔用的資源，以及如何歸還。",
  "The home tab's history and how much of it it shows.": "首頁分頁的歷程記錄，以及顯示的數量。",
  "The folders the gallery scans for pictures and videos.": "相簿掃描圖片與影片的資料夾。",
  "Icons": "圖示",
  "Where the shell's own icons and the built-in glyphs come from.": "殼層圖示與內建圖示的來源。",
  "Icons by extension": "依副檔名的圖示",
  "A custom glyph for one file extension.": "為單一副檔名指定自訂圖示。",
  "Folder icons": "資料夾圖示",
  "A single folder can carry an icon of its own.": "單一資料夾可以擁有專屬圖示。",
  "Folder index": "資料夾索引",
  "The hidden cache that makes a folder open instantly next time.": "讓資料夾下次能瞬間開啟的隱藏快取。",
  "What the listings include.": "清單包含的內容。",
  "Home folder": "主資料夾",
  "Edit location": "編輯位置",
  "Next tab": "下一個分頁",
  "Previous tab": "上一個分頁",
  "Undo": "復原",
  "Redo": "重做",
  "Invert selection": "反向選取",
  "Icons view": "圖示檢視",
  "Details view": "詳細資料檢視",
  "Open terminal": "開啟終端機",
  "Show hidden files": "顯示隱藏檔案",
  "Open in a new tab": "在新分頁中開啟",
  "Back to the default combination for every action.": "回到每個動作的預設組合。",
  "The previous folder in this tab. The mouse back button and the browser back key always work.": "此分頁中的上一個資料夾。滑鼠返回鍵與瀏覽器返回鍵一律有效。",
  "The next folder in this tab. The mouse forward button and the browser forward key always work.": "此分頁中的下一個資料夾。滑鼠前進鍵與瀏覽器前進鍵一律有效。",
  "Opens the folder that contains the current one.": "開啟包含目前資料夾的上層資料夾。",
  "Jumps to the user's home folder, like Alt+Home in Dolphin.": "跳到使用者的主資料夾，就像 Dolphin 的 Alt+Home。",
  "Opens the floating search box. Typing a letter in a folder opens it too.": "開啟浮動搜尋框。在資料夾中輸入字母也會開啟。",
  "Turns the breadcrumbs into an editable path; Ctrl+L in Dolphin.": "將麵包屑變成可編輯的路徑；Dolphin 為 Ctrl+L。",
  "Closes the tab that is open.": "關閉目前開啟的分頁。",
  "Opens the overview in a new tab.": "在新分頁中開啟概覽。",
  "Cycles to the next tab.": "循環切換到下一個分頁。",
  "Cycles to the previous tab.": "循環切換到上一個分頁。",
  "Ctrl+D copies too, following KDE's file manager.": "Ctrl+D 也可複製，遵循 KDE 檔案管理員的習慣。",
  "Moves the selection on the next paste.": "下次貼上時移動選取的項目。",
  "Copies or moves the clipboard's files into the current folder.": "將剪貼簿中的檔案複製或移動到目前資料夾。",
  "Undoes the last file operation in this session.": "復原此工作階段中最後的檔案操作。",
  "Repeats the operation that was just undone.": "重複剛剛復原的操作。",
  "Delete is Del by default, not Ctrl+D.": "刪除預設為 Del，不是 Ctrl+D。",
  "Bypasses the recycle bin; Dolphin uses Shift+Delete.": "略過資源回收筒；Dolphin 使用 Shift+Delete。",
  "Renames the single selected entry.": "重新命名單一選取的項目。",
  "Selects every entry in the current folder.": "選取目前資料夾中的每個項目。",
  "Selects everything that is not selected; Dolphin uses Ctrl+Shift+A.": "選取所有未選取的項目；Dolphin 使用 Ctrl+Shift+A。",
  "Opens the selected folder or file.": "開啟選取的資料夾或檔案。",
  "Creates a folder in the current directory. F10 also works.": "在目前目錄中建立資料夾。F10 也可使用。",
  "Opens the shell properties sheet.": "開啟殼層屬性表。",
  "Reads the current folder again.": "重新讀取目前資料夾。",
  "Switches the folder to the grid view.": "將資料夾切換為格狀檢視。",
  "Switches the folder to the list view.": "將資料夾切換為清單檢視。",
  "Opens Windows Terminal in the current folder; Dolphin uses F4 for its terminal panel.": "在目前資料夾中開啟 Windows Terminal；Dolphin 使用 F4 開啟終端機面板。",
  "Toggles ordinary hidden files for this session. Alt+. also works; system files still follow Explorer.": "切換此工作階段的普通隱藏檔案。Alt+. 也可使用；系統檔案仍遵循檔案總管。",
  "Shows the next file tab beside the current one; F3 in Dolphin.": "在目前分頁旁顯示下一個檔案分頁；Dolphin 為 F3。",
  "Hold this while clicking a folder.": "按住此鍵並點擊資料夾。",
